%[text] %[text:anchor:T_227a] # Capacitors: charge/discharge
%[text] [⇦ Main Menu](file:../MainMenu.m)
%[text] In this script, we will explore the charge and discharge of capacitors and how they can store energy. 
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:7a99)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"} %[text:anchor:M_597CA885]
