%[text] %[text:anchor:H_4a9b] ## Conclusion
%[text] In this script, we explored the essential role of capacitors in electrical circuits, focusing on their ability to store and release energy. We've determined an analytical value for the capacitance of a plate capacitor based on its physical factors. Through Simscape simulation, we explored the charge and discharge of the capacitor and illustrated how it stores energy.
